@startuml
title Figure 2 - Agile incremental cycle with XP engineering practices
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
rectangle "Select value\nstory + acceptance criteria\nplanning game" as select #E9EEFF
rectangle "Analyze and design\nsimple typed contract\nspike only for uncertainty" as analyze #F2F4F7
rectangle "Implement\nsmall change\nlead + reviewer rotation" as implement #F2F4F7
rectangle "Verify\ntests + static checks\nfake models / recorded providers" as verify #EAF8EF
rectangle "Integrate\nworking main baseline\ncontinuous integration" as integrate #F2F4F7
rectangle "Review\nuser + professor feedback\ndemonstrate evidence" as review #FFF4D8
rectangle "Reflect\nlimits + improvements\nrefactor without behavior drift" as reflect #F2EDFF
rectangle "Adapt next increment\nreprioritize story\nkeep acceptance boundary" as adapt #E9EEFF
rectangle "Communication\nshared contracts + daily review" as communication #FFFFFF
rectangle "Simplicity\nsmall typed slices; no speculative services" as simplicity #FFFFFF
rectangle "Feedback\ntests, UI evidence, demonstrations" as feedback_v #FFFFFF
rectangle "Courage\nexpose gaps and refactor" as courage #FFFFFF
rectangle "Respect\ncollective ownership and review" as respect #FFFFFF
select --> analyze : 
analyze --> implement : 
implement --> verify : 
verify --> integrate : 
integrate --> review : 
review --> reflect : 
reflect --> adapt : 
adapt --> select : feedback changes the next story; it never bypasses verification
@enduml
